## Stop conditions

Stop and mark the affected observation `HOLD` for mislabeled stock, formula-total error, dose below the 10 uL stock floor, unmatched or unknown carrier, visible instability, contamination, assessor illness, uncontrolled environment, or lost blinding. Stop skin work entirely because it is not authorized by this guide. Report adverse experience without continuing exposure.

## Claim ceiling

This protocol is ready only as a documented experimental design. It is **NOT AUTHORIZED** for physical preparation or skin test and makes no claim of sensory success. No winner, formula change, compounding, procurement, safety conclusion, stability conclusion, release, or repository-integration conclusion follows until separately authorized and evidenced.
